      "math_structure": {
        "type": "injective_preserves_independence",
        "template": "$T(\\sum c_ix_i)=0$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "答案",
          "steps": [
            "先围绕线性映射、核空间采用线性关系：假设像向量有线性关系。",
            "若 $\\sum_ic_iT(x_i)=0$，则 $T(\\sum_ic_ix_i)=0$。",
            "零核给出 $\\sum_ic_ix_i=0$，再由原向量组线性无关得全部 $c_i=0$。"
