      "solution_steps": [
        "假设存在两种表示",
        "作差并利用线性无关"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "unique_coordinates",
        "template": "$\\sum(\\alpha_i-\\beta_i)v_i=0$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "答案",
          "steps": [
            "先围绕线性无关、坐标唯一性采用作差：假设存在两种表示。",
            "若 $\\sum_i\\alpha_iv_i=\\sum_i\\beta_iv_i$，则 $\\sum_i(\\alpha_i-\\beta_i)v_i=0$。",
            "线性无关性推出 $\\alpha_i=\\beta_i$，故坐标唯一。"
